{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/499d4a92121ee6777fc8884c47545b37.avif?t=1761011879\" width=1232 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zaetherfall</strong> is a precision <strong>bullet-hell shmup</strong> where three rival aces from the <strong>URA</strong>, <strong>EUPRA</strong>, and the <strong>Sacred Eastern Dominion</strong> forge a last-chance coalition against <strong>Zael Aether</strong>\u2014a silent theocracy promising order through annihilation. <strong>Play the free demo now and add to your wishlist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap <strong>Fire</strong> and <strong>Plasma</strong> weapons to read patterns. Pop <strong>two tight-window shields</strong> with real cooldowns. Keep the <strong>chain</strong> alive to turn risk into momentum. Commanders escalate across curated phases\u2014every break reshapes the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between sorties, the campaign shifts into clean <strong>visual-novel scenes</strong>. In combat, <strong>reactive real-time dialogue</strong>\u2014taunts, clipped orders, last words\u2014responds to wave breaks, shield timing, and boss transitions. The novel clarifies the stakes; the cockpit makes you live them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Three protagonists, one coalition</strong> \u2013 Aces from URA, EUPRA, and the Sacred Eastern Dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dual-element combat</strong> \u2013 Fire/Plasma lines with distinct tempos and applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Two shields, zero forgiveness</strong> \u2013 Fire Shield / Plasma Shield with short durations and real cooldowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Chain or be chained</strong> \u2013 Risk\u2013reward combo system that turns pressure into momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Evolving commanders</strong> \u2013 Multi-phase bosses with intentional formations and curtain fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Story in the crossfire</strong> \u2013 Real-time reactive comms in mission; visual-novel interludes between missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Decisive runs</strong> \u2013 Credits, respawns, and tuned curves that reward mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Surge moments</strong> \u2013 Power-ups and a <strong>SPECIAL overdrive</strong> to flip the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PILOTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/dc04197a9acbd2cdbc4338bf40ae5822.avif?t=1761011879\" width=1232 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zack Vasquez \u2014 \u201cThe Spear of the Americas\u201d</strong> \u2022 Impulsive, loyal, instinct-led firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/261aca4639fc631e932f0db7d921ad7e.avif?t=1761011879\" width=1232 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ekaterina V\u00e4is\u00e4nen \u2014 \u201cThe Mind of Europa\u201d</strong> \u2022 Disciplined tactician; unity by choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/7d0a7d681a944fbe75ceabdd5f21780b.avif?t=1761011879\" width=1232 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wei Zhang \u2014 \u201cThe Silence of the East\u201d</strong> \u2022 Quiet, precise, unshaken; fights cultural erasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/d06d643d2fbfeec4c8684d4c18bd07c6.avif?t=1761011879\" width=1232 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DOCTRINE OF ZAEL AETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They do not speak. They cleanse. Empire as religion\u2014blood, steel, and void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They call it the <strong>Silent Divinity</strong>. We call it extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand together. Defy the divine. Burn their heaven.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the free demo and hold the line.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081670?t=1761011879","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/ebeeaabbada96c625ca836dbb2099c226330f534/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761011879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/d15c8b3a66cf761ff114fbb5ab5b20c9efc5ad5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761011879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/d15c8b3a66cf761ff114fbb5ab5b20c9efc5ad5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761011879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4085610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081670/extras/499d4a92121ee6777fc8884c47545b37.avif?t=1761011879\" width